  "description": "A robust, clean mushroom flavor makes this a great gravy to smother on steak, biscuits, mashed potatoes, pork chops, and more.",
  "notes": "Optional or for serving: 1/2 teaspoon fresh thyme, plus picked thyme leaves for garnish\n\nNotes: We recommend either homemade or store-bought chicken stock, or a combination of homemade beef stock with either type of chicken stock.\n\nMake-ahead and storage: The finished gravy can be refrigerated in an airtight container for up to 1 week; reheat over medium-low heat before serving.",
